          <attvalue for="28" value="2" />
          <attvalue for="34" value="0.7" />
          <attvalue for="35" value="Acute interruptions to key maritime routes cause immediate investor repricing of growth and inflation prospects for Europe, producing abrupt adjustments in sovereign yields and elevated short‑term bond-market volatility." />
