          <attvalue for="28" value="2" />
          <attvalue for="34" value="0.7" />
          <attvalue for="35" value="Maritime route closures and port disruptions delay or divert shipments of satellite terminals, spare parts and ground-station equipment destined for Ukrainian forces and NGOs, directly reducing usable satcom hardware and thus geographic/time coverage in the theater." />
