          <attvalue for="34" value="0.6" />
          <attvalue for="35" value="Rising war-risk and liability premiums raise operators' cost and insurers' contractual conditions for servicing high-risk areas, increasing commercial and legal incentives for providers to throttle or condition service to conflict-affected users in the Russia–Ukraine theater." />
