          <attvalue for="34" value="0.85" />
          <attvalue for="35" value="Tighter export controls on advanced chips, cooling gear and AI-specialized components immediately choke inbound shipments and vendor contracts for ongoing data‑center builds, causing planned deployments to be delayed or cancelled." />
