          <attvalue for="34" value="0.8" />
          <attvalue for="35" value="New or tightened US export controls on key tech raise immediate cross-border investment risk perceptions and trigger portfolio shifts into perceived safe‑haven assets (e.g., German Bunds, USD Treasury proxies), increasing net safe‑haven inflows to Europe." />
