          <attvalue for="28" value="2" />
          <attvalue for="34" value="0.6" />
          <attvalue for="35" value="A faster deployment rate of AI-enabled sensors and edge processing in theater raises persistent demand for satellite backhaul and spectrum, which can congest transponder capacity and reduce the proportion of time and coverage available to other users in the conflict zone." />
