          <attvalue for="34" value="0.6" />
          <attvalue for="35" value="When specialized cloud providers are more financially stable, governments and militaries have less need and leverage to intervene or press providers to re-prioritize or commandeer services, reducing the frequency and intensity of political requests to operators." />
