          <attvalue for="34" value="0.7" />
          <attvalue for="35" value="Higher sovereign borrowing costs lift baseline interest rates and corporate refinancing spreads, increasing debt-servicing and refinancing pressures on specialized cloud and AI infrastructure firms and thereby eroding their solvency margins." />
