          <attvalue for="28" value="2" />
          <attvalue for="34" value="0.6" />
          <attvalue for="35" value="Higher sovereign borrowing costs in the euro area raise financing costs for firms and reduce available public support for international R&amp;D and joint ventures, causing a measurable decline in the pace of technology transfers between European firms and Chinese partners." />
